---
// No props — content is fixed brand copy
---

<div class="iee-section">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="iee-header centered">
      <span class="overline">Our Philosophy</span>
      <h2 class="iee-heading">Innovate<span class="iee-dot">.</span> Execute<span class="iee-dot">.</span> Empower<span class="iee-dot">.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="iee-grid">

      <div class="iee-card">
        <div class="iee-word">Innovate<span class="iee-dot">.</span></div>
        <p>We cultivate deep expertise in our customers' business domain and blend that with a passion for cutting-edge technology.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="iee-card">
        <div class="iee-word">Execute<span class="iee-dot">.</span></div>
        <p>We are makers at heart and maintain the development infrastructure, tooling, and training programs to continuously refine our ability to convert ideas into working, robust solutions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="iee-card">
        <div class="iee-word">Empower<span class="iee-dot">.</span></div>
        <p>We equip our customers with the tools and expertise needed to maintain and evolve the solutions we deliver, with as little or as much of our continued support as they need.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .iee-section {
    background: var(--color-slate);
  }

  .iee-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .iee-header .overline {
    color: var(--color-blue);
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .iee-heading {
    color: var(--color-surface);
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .iee-dot {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .iee-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .iee-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .iee-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .iee-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
  }

  .iee-word {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 1.9rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-surface);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .iee-card p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.72;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
